      "id": "ARS-02",
      "chapter": "lifts",
      "anchor": "lifts-geometric-real-polarization",
      "title": "The polarized complex structure and its scalar traces",
      "hypotheses": "The rank-n arithmetic trace form, the quadratic CM type cut out by ω, and a purely imaginary δ in the trace codifferent with negative imaginary part on the selected type.",
